#. module: sale_order_purchase_order_link
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_purchase_order_link.field_sale_order__purchase_order_count_technical
msgid ""
"Technical field that does the same thing as the \"purchase_order_count\" "
"field of the \"sale_purchase\" module but without including the \"groups\" "
"which restricts its visibility and use to users who do not belong to the "
"\"Purchases/User\" group."
msgstr ""
"Campo técnico que hace lo mismo que el campo “purchase_order_count” del "
"módulo “sale_purchase” pero sin incluir los “grupos” que restringen su "
"visibilidad y uso a usuarios que no pertenecen al grupo “Compras/Usuario”."
